                "caption": "Figure 1:Gaze target estimation in in-the-wild environments. Prior methods such as Sharingan and ViTGaze have to rely on an Open-Vocabulary Detector (OVD) to produce auxiliary head boxes via dynamic human prompts, introducing a sequential dependency that becomes a major bottleneck.",
